{"seq":3,"slug":"community-detection","title":"社区检测与摘要","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-rag-knowledge/construction/community-detection","wordCount":1655,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"社区检测与摘要\">社区检测与摘要</h1><p>一张几万节点的全局图，单看任何一个节点和它的邻居，都只是局部细节；可如果问「这整批语料在讲什么、有哪些大主题」，没有任何一个节点能回答。Microsoft GraphRAG 的关键创新，就是在建好的图上做<strong>社区检测</strong>——把紧密相连的节点聚成一个个「社区」（大致对应一个主题、一个团伙、一个子领域），再为每个社区生成一份摘要报告。于是「全局问题」有了抓手：不必读完所有原文，只需聚合相关社区的摘要。这一步是 GraphRAG 能回答 <a href=\"why-graph-rag\">为何图谱 RAG</a> 里那类全局概览问题的直接前提，也是它最贵的一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>社区检测是 GraphRAG 回答全局问题的前提，也是它最贵的一步。几个概念先摆清：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>社区</strong>：图上紧密相连的节点聚成的一组，大致对应一个主题、一个团伙、一个子领域。</li>\n<li><strong>模块度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：衡量划分好坏的指标——实际组内边数减去随机连边时期望的组内边数，正得越多说明划分越捕捉到真实结构；社区检测算法就是在最大化它。</li>\n<li><strong>Leiden 而非 Louvain</strong>：Leiden 保证每个社区内部连通、收敛更稳，避免 Louvain 产出「内部断裂」的社区（那会让摘要变成两个主题的拼盘）。</li>\n<li><strong>层次化社区树</strong>：Leiden 产出多层社区，可按查询粒度选层——宏观查顶层、具体查底层。</li>\n<li><strong>社区报告</strong>：对每个社区、每个层级各生成一份 LLM 摘要，是 Global Search 的检索单元，也是索引成本的第二大头。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;全局图&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Leiden 分层聚类&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;细粒度社区&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;粗粒度主题&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;社区报告 · LLM 摘要&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;全局查询 map-reduce&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"全局图\"] --&gt; B[\"Leiden 分层聚类\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"细粒度社区\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"粗粒度主题\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"社区报告 · LLM 摘要\"]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[\"全局查询 map-reduce\"]</pre><h2 id=\"社区是什么-模块度直觉\">社区是什么：模块度直觉</h2><p>社区检测的目标，是把图划分成若干组，使得<strong>组内的边远多于组间的边</strong>。衡量这种「划得好不好」的经典指标是模块度（modularity）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = \\frac{1}{2m} \\sum_{i,j} \\left( A_{ij} - \\frac{k_i k_j}{2m} \\right) \\delta(c_i, c_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是邻接矩阵、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是总边数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta(c_i,c_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i,j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 同社区时为 1。式子的含义是「实际的组内边数」减去「随机连边时期望的组内边数」——正得越多，说明这个划分越不像随机、越捕捉到了真实结构。社区检测算法就是在最大化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>。直觉上：一篇并购语料里，「张三-X公司-Y公司-某投行」这几个高度互连的实体会自然聚成一个「这笔交易」的社区。</p>\n<h2 id=\"leiden-为什么不用-louvain\">Leiden：为什么不用 Louvain</h2><p>GraphRAG 用的是 <strong>Leiden 算法</strong>，而非更老的 Louvain。Louvain 有个著名缺陷：它可能产出<strong>内部不连通的社区</strong>（一个社区里的节点其实分成了互不相连的两块，只因优化过程把它们误归一组）。Leiden 在 Louvain 基础上加了一步「refinement」，保证每个社区内部连通，并且收敛更快、质量更稳。这对 GraphRAG 至关重要——一个内部断裂的社区，摘要出来会是两个不相干主题的拼盘，污染全局检索。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  G[全局图] --&gt; L0[Leiden 第 0 层&lt;br/&gt;细粒度社区]&#10;  L0 --&gt; S0[每个社区→社区报告&lt;br/&gt;LLM 摘要]&#10;  L0 --&gt; L1[向上聚合&lt;br/&gt;第 1 层粗社区]&#10;  L1 --&gt; S1[更粗的社区报告]&#10;  L1 --&gt; L2[第 2 层&lt;br/&gt;更粗主题]&#10;  L2 --&gt; S2[顶层主题报告]&#10;  S0 --&gt; Q{全局查询}&#10;  S1 --&gt; Q&#10;  S2 --&gt; Q&#10;  Q --&gt; MR[选合适层级的报告&lt;br/&gt;map-reduce 聚合成答案]\">flowchart TD\n  G[全局图] --&gt; L0[Leiden 第 0 层&lt;br/&gt;细粒度社区]\n  L0 --&gt; S0[每个社区→社区报告&lt;br/&gt;LLM 摘要]\n  L0 --&gt; L1[向上聚合&lt;br/&gt;第 1 层粗社区]\n  L1 --&gt; S1[更粗的社区报告]\n  L1 --&gt; L2[第 2 层&lt;br/&gt;更粗主题]\n  L2 --&gt; S2[顶层主题报告]\n  S0 --&gt; Q{全局查询}\n  S1 --&gt; Q\n  S2 --&gt; Q\n  Q --&gt; MR[选合适层级的报告&lt;br/&gt;map-reduce 聚合成答案]</pre><p>Leiden 天然是<strong>层次化</strong>的：它能产出一棵社区树——底层是细粒度的小社区（一笔具体交易），逐层向上聚合成更粗的主题（整个行业的并购潮）。这棵树让 GraphRAG 能按查询的「粒度」选择在哪一层检索：细问题查底层、宏观问题查顶层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"社区摘要-把成本花在这里\">社区摘要：把成本花在这里</h2><p>社区分好之后，GraphRAG 对<strong>每一个社区、每一个层级</strong>调用 LLM 生成一份<strong>社区报告（community report）</strong>——通常包含标题、摘要、关键实体与关系、重要性评分。这份报告是查询期 Global Search 的检索单元：回答全局问题时，系统不读原文，而是把相关社区报告做 map-reduce 汇总（每份报告先各自产出部分答案，再归并），这套聚合机制是 <a href=\"../retrieval/multi-hop-reasoning\">多跳推理</a> 的主题。</p>\n<p>但这一步正是<strong>索引成本的第二大头</strong>（第一是抽取）：社区数量可能成千上万，层级又有好几层，每个都要一次 LLM 调用。这解释了为什么原始 GraphRAG 索引能贵到 $33,000 量级。两条主流省钱路线都冲着这步来：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>LazyGraphRAG</strong>：索引时<strong>根本不预生成社区摘要</strong>，把摘要推迟到查询时只对相关子图现算。索引成本因此降到原方案的 0.1%（向量量级），代价是单次全局查询更慢更贵。</li>\n<li><strong>LightRAG</strong>：干脆不依赖整体社区结构，改用查询期的双层关键词检索绕过预摘要——既省了这笔钱，又顺带获得增量更新能力。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这条「预算 vs 现算」的取舍，正是 <a href=\"../foundations/graph-rag-patterns\">模式谱系</a> 的主轴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分层粒度怎么选\">分层粒度怎么选</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>查询粒度</th>\n<th>用哪一层社区</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>取舍</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>宏观主题</td>\n<td>顶层（粗）</td>\n<td>「这批语料整体趋势」</td>\n<td>报告少、覆盖广、细节糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中观领域</td>\n<td>中层</td>\n<td>「并购板块有哪些主线」</td>\n<td>平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>具体团簇</td>\n<td>底层（细）</td>\n<td>「这笔交易的来龙去脉」</td>\n<td>报告多、精确、易超 context</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单点实体</td>\n<td>不走社区</td>\n<td>「张三是谁」</td>\n<td>走 local search 即可</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践要点：<strong>不是所有问题都该走社区摘要</strong>。围绕具体实体的局部问题，走 <a href=\"../retrieval/graph-traversal-retrieval\">图遍历检索</a> 的 local search 更准更省；只有真正的全局概览问题才值得动用社区报告。把每类问题路由到合适的检索层，是 <a href=\"../retrieval/hybrid-graph-vector\">图向量混合</a> 要解决的事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>社区检测把图聚成「组内边远多于组间边」的社区，用<strong>模块度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></strong> 衡量划分质量，让「全局问题」有了不必读全文的抓手。</li>\n<li>GraphRAG 用 <strong>Leiden 而非 Louvain</strong>，因为 Leiden 保证社区内部连通、收敛更稳——内部断裂的社区会让摘要变成主题拼盘。</li>\n<li>Leiden 产出<strong>层次化社区树</strong>，可按查询粒度选层检索：宏观查顶层、具体查底层。</li>\n<li><strong>社区摘要是索引成本第二大头</strong>（每社区每层一次 LLM 调用），LazyGraphRAG 延迟到查询时、LightRAG 干脆绕过，都是冲它省钱。</li>\n<li>不是所有问题都走社区：局部问题该走图遍历，只有全局概览才动用社区报告。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：图怎么建出来见 <a href=\"graph-construction\">图谱构建</a>；社区报告怎么 map-reduce 成答案见 <a href=\"../retrieval/multi-hop-reasoning\">多跳推理</a>；各流派对这步的取舍见 <a href=\"../foundations/graph-rag-patterns\">模式谱系</a>。</li>\n<li>同 hub：摘要成本细账见 <a href=\"../practice/graph-rag-cost\">成本与维护</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：图算法与图嵌入的更系统处理见 <a href=\"../../knowledge-graphs/kg-reasoning/graph-embedding\">知识图谱 · 图嵌入</a>；社区报告作为知识库工程一环见 <a href=\"../../rag-knowledge-systems/knowledge-base-engineering/document-ingestion-pipeline\">RAG 知识系统 · 知识库工程</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"社区检测与摘要","id":"社区检测与摘要"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"社区是什么：模块度直觉","id":"社区是什么-模块度直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"Leiden：为什么不用 Louvain","id":"leiden-为什么不用-louvain"},{"level":2,"text":"社区摘要：把成本花在这里","id":"社区摘要-把成本花在这里"},{"level":2,"text":"分层粒度怎么选","id":"分层粒度怎么选"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"图谱构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-rag-knowledge/construction/graph-construction"},"next":{"title":"图遍历检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-rag-knowledge/retrieval/graph-traversal-retrieval"}}